# This repo holds the DEPLOYED SITE ONLY.
#
# Netlify's publish directory is the repo root, so anything committed here is
# publicly fetchable. The strategy docs, briefs, research CSVs, badge art and
# superseded drafts all stay on disk but deliberately out of version control.
#
# Everything is ignored by default. To add a new file to the live site you MUST
# unignore it explicitly below — otherwise it will silently never deploy.

*

!.gitignore
!base.html
!_redirects
!img/
!img/*
!_headers
